{"id":1757453,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-28T21:38:26.914Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":500000,"genres":[{"id":27,"name":"Horror"}],"homepage":"","id":1757453,"imdb_id":"tt44878454","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Induced Reality","overview":"It starts as a normal day. A young boy sits quietly in his car seat, but an overwhelming wave of nausea quickly gives way to a terrifying realization—his surroundings are glitching. Objects appear out of place, reality feels distorted, and a deep sense of dread takes over. As the hallucinations intensify, a sudden spike of adrenaline fractures the illusion.He realizes this fake reality is a protective trick played by his own mind. Hours earlier in the waking world, a massive summer storm was brewing. Plunging out of his subconscious prayer and back into stark reality, he wakes up at 5:00 PM to a world consumed by an unnatural darkness. A monstrous tornado is actively forming right outside. With mere seconds left on the clock, he must brave the howling winds, rescue his cats, and make a desperate run for the storm bunker in a terrifying race against a force that almost claims his life.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":306410,"logo_path":null,"name":"K76 Films","origin_country":""},{"id":308892,"logo_path":null,"name":"Silver Sky Productions","origin_country":""},{"id":308893,"logo_path":null,"name":"HD Cinema Productions","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":600000,"runtime":7,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"I see the sky, I see the death","title":"Induced Reality","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":6389161,"known_for_department":"Creator","name":"Oleg Pihosh","original_name":"Oleg Pihosh","popularity":0.2625,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":11,"character":"Alex","credit_id":"6a9